[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_SOUTH_LUNA]
South Luna Ocean Development Company

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_SOUTH_LUNA_desc]
LPMIG has decided to put its main assets and efforts into the military competition in the South Luna Ocean region, so it is necessary to establish a South Luna Ocean Development Company. This decision is based on the cooperation agreement between LPMIG and LPEG, as well as the strategic importance of the South Luna Ocean region. We need to establish a strong military presence in the South Luna Ocean to protect friendship and freedom. Of course, by the way, it can also help Saddle Arabia protect their oil and mineral resources, just by the way.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_SOUTH_LUNA]
南露娜洋发展公司

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_SOUTH_LUNA_desc]
洛马基军工集团决定将公司主要资产和精力投入到南露娜洋区域的军事竞赛中去，因此有必要建立南露娜洋发展公司。这个决定是基于洛马基军工集团和洛马基能源集团的合作协议以及南露娜洋区域的战略重要性。我们需要再南露娜洋建立强大的军事存在，以保护友谊和自由。当然，顺便可以帮助鞍拉伯保护一下石油和矿产资源，只是顺便。

